      "description": "A young girl is being carried on the back of a man in a red shirt and black jacket. The scene is set outdoors in what appears to be a public area with other people in the background. The overlaid text accuses 'liberal women in favor of Islam' of enabling the sale of child brides into sexual slavery. The man carrying the child is the central figure, and the child is positioned on his back, suggesting movement and urgency. The background includes other individuals, some in traditional attire, indicating a culturally specific setting. The overall composition frames the act of carrying the child as part of a larger narrative of exploitation and human trafficking.",
