      "description": "The top text 'to all you liberal \"women\" in favor of islam' explicitly addresses the viewer as 'you', projecting the user onto the group being targeted. This creates a direct address, making the user feel personally implicated or targeted by the meme's message. The projection is onto the textual material, specifically the top_text entity, which uses 'you' to frame the user as part of the group being accused.",
