      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_2",
      "label": "User projected onto the victim in the scene",
      "description": "The bottom text 'this young lady is being sold into sexual slavery as child bride' uses 'this young lady' to explicitly point to the visual entity of the child being carried. This deictic reference projects the user's attention and emotional response onto the child, making the user feel they are witnessing or responsible for the depicted event. The projection is onto the visual material, specifically the 'child_bride_sale_scene' entity, which is the central visual focus.",
